// bootstrap: adaptive_pruning — 自适应剪枝: 熵阈值+分支因子

Point adaptive_pruning:
  entropy_threshold(node: Node, alpha: float) -> bool
  branch_factor(node: Node, limit: int) -> int
  prune(search_tree: Tree, policy: PrunePolicy) -> Tree

Constraint adaptive_pruning:
  prune does not eliminate optimal solutions
  entropy_threshold adapts to search_depth
  branch_factor limits combinatorial explosion

Prove;
Normalize;
